an’t kick the blanket off; it has to heat up until it glows brighter in the infrared. In short: - **Past stability:** Balance. - **Present warming:** Imbalance → heat accumulation. - **Future stability (if we stop emitting):** A new balance at a higher temperature. So your instinct is spot on. The heat really is building up, and that’s the core of the problem.
